OL,3,GNEWSAAncient supervolcano found under
OL,4,AEnglish coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Tim Pharaoh of the BGS said the
OL,7,Fdiscovery was a "fantastic result",
OL,8,Fchanging "our understanding of
OL,9,FEngland's deep geological past".
